'''Sceptres''' is an [[item class]] of one-handed [[melee]] [[weapons]] that require [[strength]] and [[intelligence]] and have a {{c|mod|x% increased Elemental Damage}} [[implicit]] [[modifier]]. 

[[Maraketh weapon]]s with this item class have a {{c|mod|Damage Penetrates x% Elemental Resistances}} [[implicit]] instead.

[[Experimented base types|Experimented ]] sceptres have [[keystone]] passives as implicit ([[Elemental Overload]] or [[Elemental Equilibrium]] or [[Secrets of Suffering]]). 

